message: "If you use this proposal or the draft K-gram schema, cite the repository version you used."
title: "Prior-Relative Sparse Context: Knowledge Grams for Selective Activation of Model-Relative Memory"
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-11-15
license: CC-BY-4.0
abstract: >-
  A research proposal for compiling external context into addressable Knowledge
  Grams that reference reusable patterns, store model-relative residuals, retain
  provenance and dependencies, and activate only a query-specific working set.
